[0m17:42:03.115345 [debug] [Thread-3 (]: Writing injected SQL for node "model.gn_dw_silver.FACT_MEMBER_EVENT"
[0m17:42:03.125501 [debug] [Thread-2 (]: SQL status: SUCCESS 1 in 0.898 seconds
