-- [O45] 회원 귀속 차원. 1행/회원이므로 fan-out 0(실측 확인).
left join GN_DW.GOLD.DIM_MEMBER_ACQUISITION acq on acq.MEMBER_DK = f.MEMBER_DK
    );
