      PREV_MONTH_END_ACTIVE_CNT COMMENT $$전월말 활동회원(건) (#53)$$,
      CAMPAIGN_UNPAID_CNT COMMENT $$캠페인별 미납(건) (#83)$$,
      STATUS_UNPAID_CNT COMMENT $$회원상태별 미납(건) (#84)$$,
      REGULAR_FEE COMMENT $$정기회비(원) (#66)$$,
